      "statement": "As of the Spring Boot 4.0.8 bump, reactor-netty-http is declared as an explicit build.gradle.kts dependency because Spring AI 2.0.1 no longer pulls it in transitively; without it, RaindropApiClientImpl's auto-configured RestClient (and other outbound RestClient calls) would silently fall back to the JDK HttpClient transport.",
